📘 MASTER KNOWLEDGEBASE
Multi-Role Logistics + Commerce Platform

Canonical Version – Current Architecture

1. SYSTEM IDENTITY

What this app is:

A multi-business, multi-role logistics and commerce platform that supports:

Multiple independent businesses

Operational roles per business

Storefront customers

Delivery drivers

Offline tolerance

Scalable authority without centralized “admin” roles

What this app is NOT:

Not a frontend-only toy

Not a decentralized-from-day-one experiment

Not a platform with a god-mode admin

2. CORE PRINCIPLES

Ownership > Roles

Capabilities are computed, not assigned

Supabase is the source of truth (launch phase)

Offline = cache + outbox, never the authority

UI never talks directly to infrastructure

Decentralization is a future data backend swap, not a rewrite

3. AUTHENTICATION & IDENTITY
Primary Auth (Launch)

Supabase Auth

