5. DERIVED AUTHORITY (CRITICAL)
Multi-Business Owner (Computed Capability)

A business_owner who owns 2 or more businesses automatically gains multi-business capabilities.

This is:

NOT a stored role

NOT a flag

NOT manually assigned

It is derived from data.

isMultiBusinessOwner = ownedBusinesses.length >= 2

