9. DATA AUTHORITY MODEL
Source of Truth

Supabase Postgres

Supporting Systems

Supabase Realtime (dispatch, driver status)

Supabase Storage (images, proofs)

Local Storage

IndexedDB:

read cache

offline outbox

Never authoritative

10. OFFLINE MODEL (NON-NEGOTIABLE)
IndexedDB Stores

cache_* (products, orders, assignments)

outbox:

{
  id
  type
  payload
  createdAt
  status
}

Rules

Offline actions → outbox

Online reconnect → sync

Server timestamps win

High-risk actions blocked offline (config, reassignment)

11. DATA CLIENT ABSTRACTION (MANDATORY)

UI never calls Supabase directly.

All access goes through:

DataClient.orders.create()
DataClient.inventory.adjust()
DataClient.dispatch.assign()

Implementations

SupabaseDataClient (now)

SxTDataClient (future)

HybridDataClient (later)

This is how decentralization happens without rewriting the app.

